p, but I'm still nervous it won't last.", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 90}, {"session_id": "p000563-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "That's a good idea. Planning more meetups could help, but I'm still nervous it won't last.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 90}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T083724Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T084444Z", "first_seen_session": "p000563-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000563-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
